    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this three bedroom, recently renovated and ideally located property to the market tucked away within this highly sought after development of Clondalkin. The Millcourt Development continues to be in high demand due to its mature surroundings and well-proportioned homes. Within walking distance you will find Corkagh Park, Clondalkin Village and a host of shops, schools and leisure facilities, not to mention the M50 Motorway and The Luas all within a couple of minutes drive. Bright and spacious interior living accommodation of c. 86 Sqm comprises of entrance hallway, lounge and kitchen/dining room to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three bedrooms, with master benefitting from ensuite and also the family bathroom. Externally to the rear you will find a fully enclosed garden whilst the front benefits from a driveway for off road parking. No. 10 is presented in excellent condition throughout and boasts newly laid carpet, gas fired central heating and double glazed windows throughout. Based on size, location, condition and the added benefit of having no onward chain we see this being extremely popular so please call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange a viewing.\n\n\nKey Features\nBer C2\nc. 86 Sqm\nNo onward chain\nFresh flooring and paint throughout\nDriveway to Front\nPopular development\nWell-presented throughout\nClose to amenities\nMature location\nFantastic opportunity\n3 bed, 2 bath\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nD22 N5W6"
      },
